m/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-06-18T17:14:03Z","updated_at":"2026-06-26T16:49:44Z","closed_at":"2026-06-23T12:02:18Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120403","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120403","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120403.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120403.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-23T12:02:18Z"},"body":"# What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Fixes #120379\r\n- Spersedes/Closes #120384\r\n- Spersedes/Closes #120392\r\n\r\nFix the issue in a more robust way than #120392.\r\n\r\nAfter all, fundamental issue is the timing of saving and loading. The current implementation is clearly too frequent.\r\n\r\nEven if we remove the excessive saves, the state is actually maintained in memory, but because the loading is excessive, the leaded `.cfg`'s value overwrites the state in memory.\r\n\r\nI will remove both the excessive saves and loads. I assume the reason for the excessive saves was to maintain the state of the animation as an **imported resource**, so I will handle that as a special case within `_fill_folds()`. I have added a dirty flag for the special case determination.\r\n\r\nWith this PR, saving and loading of folding will now align with the saving and loading timings of Animations or scenes. In MRP, I have confirmed that the renaming speed is equivalent to that of 4.6.\r\n\r\nFor AnimationPlayers created in the editor, I have confirmed that folding is maintained during renaming in the SceneTree. The renaming behavior for Make Local Imported AnimationPlayers seems unstable, but since this is an issue that existed before this PR, it is unrelated (it remains the same as previous behavior, excluding performance change).\r\n\r\ncc @Meorge @akien-mga @KoBeWi ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120403/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120403/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}